# Netlify redirects. Old GHL URLs → new clean URLs (add as needed once live).
# The free .netlify.app subdomain serves the site as a 200 duplicate unless forced
# to the canonical domain (GSC duplicate-canonical flag). Domain-level rules only
# work from THIS file — the netlify.toml equivalent silently never fires.
https://406frontdesk.netlify.app/*  https://406frontdesk.com/:splat  301!
# Example:
# /old-path   /new-path   301
/book   https://links.406frontdesk.com/widget/bookings/406-20-minute-demo   302
# GHL blog taxonomy pages (no equivalent) -> blog index
/blog/category/*   /blog/   301
/blog/author/*     /blog/   301
# Legacy GHL funnel slugs Google indexed (GSC "Not found (404)" alert 2026-07-18)
/kalispell-trt   /ktrt-opt-in/   301
/widget          /demo/          301
/preview         /               301
# GHL's internal funnel-preview path (the actual GSC-reported 404, crawled 5/31)
/_preview/*      /               301
# Googlebot extracts URL-like strings from inline JS: the ROI calculator's "/month"
# suffix was crawled as a path and 404'd, failing GSC 404 validation (found 2026-08-20).
/month           /roi/           301
